{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2022-05-25 12:00:00', 'title': 'NISOURCE ANNOUNCES LEADERSHIP CHANGES AND ADDITIONS', 'text': "MELODY BIRMINGHAM, WILLIAM (BILL) JEFFERSON AND MELANIE BERMAN JOIN EXECUTIVE LEADERSHIP TEAM MERRILLVILLE, IND. , MAY 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NISOURCE INC. (NYSE: NI) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENTS OF MELODY BIRMINGHAM, WILLIAM (BILL) JEFFERSON, AND MELANIE BERMAN TO THE COMPANY'S EXECUTIVE LEADERSHIP TEAM, ALONG WITH A RECONFIGURATION OF LEADERSHIP RESPONSIBILITIES FOR SEVERAL OTHERS ON THAT TEAM."}